const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文研究收益率曲线变化中的共同成分，通常用水平、斜率和曲率模式描述利率的联动。 阅读时应将其放回原始样本、时点和制度环境中理解，不能把问题本身当作跨市场结论。",en:"The article studies common movements in yield-curve changes, commonly described through level, slope, and curvature patterns in interest-rate data. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.3905/jfi.1991.692347",label:{zh:"The Journal of Fixed Income · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Fixed Income · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它对不同期限利率变化进行因子分解，曲线构造、工具集合、期限映射、采样频率和因子提取惯例共同定义比较。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中任一选择，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It uses a factor decomposition of rate changes across maturities, so the curve construction, instrument set, maturity mapping, sampling frequency, and factor-extraction convention define the comparison. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.3905/jfi.1991.692347",label:{zh:"The Journal of Fixed Income · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Fixed Income · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要带日期的不同期限收益率或价格、工具和报价惯例、曲线构造、日历、缺失报价处理、币种市场范围和因子标准化。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选必须与原研究分开记录，不能因变量同名或使用最新修订值便视为可比。",en:"Inputs need dated yields or prices across identified maturities, instrument and quote conventions, curve-construction rules, calendars, missing-quote treatment, currency and market scope, and factor normalization. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.3905/jfi.1991.692347",label:{zh:"The Journal of Fixed Income · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Fixed Income · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"来源描述历史债券收益变化的共同成分，不会让某个因子标签成为预测、完整风险模型或当前收益率走势判断。 它只支持来源描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The source describes common components of historical bond-return variation; it does not make a factor label a forecast, a complete risk model, or a statement about current yield movements. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.3905/jfi.1991.692347",label:{zh:"The Journal of Fixed Income · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Fixed Income · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"记录工具资格和期限桶；保留收益率惯例和币种；对齐观测时间；记录插值和缺失规则；固定因子符号和尺度；区分利率变化与总收益。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Record instrument eligibility and maturity buckets; preserve yield convention and currency; align observation times; document interpolation and missing-data rules; fix factor sign and scale; and separate rate moves from total returns. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.3905/jfi.1991.692347",label:{zh:"The Journal of Fixed Income · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Fixed Income · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Journal of Fixed Income · DOI record。历史因子分解不能替代证券级定价、信用分析、久期惯例或当前配置建议。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Journal of Fixed Income · DOI record. A historical factor decomposition cannot replace security-level pricing, credit analysis, duration conventions, or a current allocation recommendation. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.3905/jfi.1991.692347",label:{zh:"The Journal of Fixed Income · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Fixed Income · DOI record · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Common Factors Affecting Bond Returns”公开说明的研究对象、设计与适用边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。历史因子分解不能替代证券级定价、信用分析、久期惯例或当前配置建议。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Common Factors Affecting Bond Returns”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
